Cell["\<\
Mixed canonical form centered at site 3 \[Dash] sites 1 and 2 are \
left-isometric, sites 4 through 6 are right-isometric, and site 3 holds the \
wavefunction's spectral weight:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->100000030,ExpressionUUID->"27c02db3-c704-479d-91b1-fa90f8b35745"],

